    "class": "gps-632340010162455125 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632340010078569045&sectionId=632340010162455125)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYFcvzSzbH_text","label":"ggYFcvzSzbH_text","default":"Moving Away? Give a Personalized Gift They'll Always Remember"},{"type":"html","id":"ggm_kapswme_text","label":"ggm_kapswme_text","default":"<p><i>Distance may separate people, but meaningful memories have a way of keeping hearts close.</i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguXB9fH42c_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gguXB9fH42c_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/cd28de3e-9da1-4387-9a3c-5947ba0cdba1.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOg-GZwP6c_text","label":"ggOg-GZwP6c_text","default":"<p>Moving away is the beginning of a new chapter, but it also means saying goodbye to familiar places and the people who made them feel like home.</p><p>Whether it's a close friend starting a new job, a family member relocating to another city, or a loved one moving across the country, these moments are often filled with mixed emotions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>While it's never easy to say goodbye, a thoughtful gift can remind someone that the memories you've shared will always travel with them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A personalized gift turns those special moments into a lasting keepsake, giving them something meaningful to look at whenever they miss home or the people they love.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoQt6jhBvR_text","label":"ggoQt6jhBvR_text","default":"Why Personalized Farewell Gifts Mean So Much"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiUex3Tnfr_text","label":"ggiUex3Tnfr_text","default":"<p>When someone is moving away, the best gifts aren't always the biggest or most expensive they're the ones that carry meaning.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A personalized gift reflects the memories you've created together, making it far more memorable than something bought off the shelf.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every time they see it, they'll be reminded of the laughter, adventures, milestones, and friendships that made their time with you unforgettable.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0FjaasHBr_text","label":"gg0FjaasHBr_text","default":"Home Is More Than a Place It's the Memories You Take With You"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaUuk63033_text","label":"ggaUuk63033_text","default":"<p>When people move, they leave behind more than a house, a school, or an office. They leave behind neighbors who became friends, weekend adventures, family traditions, and everyday moments that quietly became some of life's most treasured memories.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Memobrick gives those moments a new home. By transforming a meaningful photo into a personalized brick mosaic, you're giving more than a keepsake you're giving a piece of the life you've shared together. As they build it or display it in their new home, they'll be reminded that no matter where life takes them, the memories you created together will always be close.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1gfJaHRKb_text","label":"gg1gfJaHRKb_text","default":"Thoughtful Memories Worth Turning Into a Memobrick"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoBopCdlDI_text","label":"ggoBopCdlDI_text","default":"<p>Some memories become even more meaningful when someone is starting a new chapter.</p><p>Consider using photos like:</p><ul><li>Family gatherings and holiday celebrations.</li><li>Graduation day.</li><li>Your favorite travel adventure together.</li><li>Childhood memories.</li><li>A wedding or anniversary.</li><li>A beloved pet.</li><li>A favorite group photo with friends.</li><li>A farewell party.</li><li>A special everyday moment that always makes you smile.</li></ul><p>The best photo isn't always the most perfect one it's the one that tells the story you'll never want to forget.</p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
    "locales": {}
  }
{% endschema %}